Comment: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato. 23 TL
Comment: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Next Episode
Comment: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,"The Day That Comes Tomorrow…"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.27,0:00:06.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Fujimoto-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:09.11,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.19,0:00:13.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You know you’re early. {Keeper: orig line "I know you’re early."}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.45,0:00:14.36,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.03,0:00:17.03,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Every single morning…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.45,0:00:19.28,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you want today?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.28,0:00:21.70,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! I’m helping today!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:26.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san, I’ll be helping you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.46,0:00:28.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Geez, see here now…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.09,0:00:29.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.46,0:00:32.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Kobato-san, Fujimoto-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.17,0:00:34.26,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.26,0:00:35.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you helping today?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:36.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.76,0:00:40.54,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-kun must be really relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.54,0:00:42.43,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’ve got to be kidding. {Keeper: orig line "Don’t kid with me like that."}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.43,0:00:44.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Why do I need to be helped?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.06,0:00:48.02,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-san, be sure to look out for him.{ori:Kobato-san, don’t let anyone down, okay?}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.56,0:00:53.03,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If you take your eyes off Fujimoto-kun again, he’ll overdo things again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.65,0:00:54.82,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{opening}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.71,0:02:31.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Every freaking day…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.26,0:02:38.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I can do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.09,0:02:41.30,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.55,0:02:44.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I found this, so I’ll put it up over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.93,0:02:46.68,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, don’t just go off and…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.52,0:02:54.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What else should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,"…Kobato’s Wish."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.11,0:03:01.57,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Where are you going today?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.20,0:03:05.91,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You went to the library yesterday,\Nand to the university the day before…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.70,0:03:08.29,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,My job.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.29,0:03:11.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I heard you had a break from work today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.19,0:03:14.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Didn’t I tell you already?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.96,0:03:15.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t give me any sympa{\fscx200)}-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.21,0:03:17.88,KO,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s not sympathy or pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.76,0:03:21.40,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought I told you it was a bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.05,0:03:26.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san, have you taken a walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.64,0:03:27.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.47,0:03:31.73,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Walks are nice. They’re fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.73,0:03:33.15,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,Fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.81,0:03:35.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Only for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.73,0:03:39.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s go… to a fun place!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.78,0:03:40.74,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.65,0:03:45.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I see, they went out together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.29,0:03:49.33,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.25,0:03:52.04,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,They need time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.83,0:03:54.29,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyone would…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.83,0:03:57.88,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Just like the two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.39,0:04:13.98,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’s the big idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.69,0:04:18.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.98,0:04:23.78,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san, this part here of yours has always been scrunched up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.24,0:04:28.87,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,So I want Fujimoto-san to have some fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.66,0:04:34.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Boats!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.25,0:04:36.33,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san, let’s ride a boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.58,0:04:38.67,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Boats, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.17,0:04:41.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.18,0:04:49.05,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like they cost money.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.40,0:05:00.90,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, hey…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.82,0:05:03.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.82,0:05:05.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’ll hit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.37,0:05:13.29,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Switch places.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.29,0:05:15.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.00,0:05:16.54,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san, you’re injured!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{roof}Boat Rentals
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.79,0:05:19.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if you say that, we’ll never get back at this rate!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.50,0:05:23.01,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Never get back…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.22,0:05:29.05,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll work hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.05,0:05:31.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll work hard and row, so…!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.06,0:05:38.31,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Achoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.19,0:05:42.36,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t bring the oar down so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.36,0:05:43.07,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.57,0:05:45.07,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Use your legs too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.07,0:05:46.07,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.07,0:05:47.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,1, 2…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.70,0:05:50.66,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We’re moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.66,0:05:52.37,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.83,0:05:54.66,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,How carefree.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.46,0:05:58.87,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.37,0:06:00.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.54,0:06:03.67,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’ve gotten a little better there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.05,0:06:11.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’re you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.76,0:06:17.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, to help cheer Fujimoto-san up, I was thinking of feeding the fish…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.39,0:06:18.73,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s not what I mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.73,0:06:21.15,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know what you’re dealing with right now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.36,0:06:22.44,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.44,0:06:25.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san had to pay for me again…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.90,0:06:27.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But this time I made sure I received some change…{ori:But this time I brought some bait, so…}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.91,0:06:31.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Not that, damnit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.24,0:06:34.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,How many times do you think I’ve said it? We’re losing time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.49,0:06:37.37,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! That’s why I’ll work hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.00,0:06:42.88,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s hurry and get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.88,0:06:45.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, I’m not done talking with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.21,0:06:46.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! {Keeper: orig line "Hey, I’m not talking with you! Hey!"}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.05,0:06:53.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh fishies, here’s some food!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.51,0:06:55.14,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you around?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.18,0:06:58.27,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san, what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.27,0:06:59.85,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.23,0:07:05.02,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I can’t relax when someone’s sticking around all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.11,0:07:11.70,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.83,0:07:22.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s go, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.42,0:07:25.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don’t get at least one confetti…{ori:If you don’t take every moment to gather confetti…}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.25,0:07:26.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.42,0:07:29.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.97,0:07:32.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it’s just Kohaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.88,0:07:34.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Taking a walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.55,0:07:37.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The weather’s really nice today, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.64,0:07:40.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, geez, what’s with this easy-going mood?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.89,0:07:42.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’s wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.23,0:07:43.60,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kohaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.60,0:07:45.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Go give this fellow easy-goer a lecture!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.19,0:07:47.36,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,To Kobato-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.36,0:07:48.36,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.36,0:07:53.57,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,She’s forgotten her wish and is just\Nfluttering about like a mad butterfly…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.57,0:07:55.07,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I haven’t forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.03,0:08:01.41,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,My wish is already decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.33,0:08:06.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.37,0:08:46.29,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’s going on with that Dobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.96,0:08:48.67,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Stupid pigeon-girl.{ori:For being a dobato…}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.92,0:08:51.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you angry, Ioryogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.55,0:08:53.34,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I’m angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.51,0:08:57.14,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m angry, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.68,0:08:59.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,When she makes that face…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.47,0:09:03.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-san made her decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.68,0:09:05.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,She’s an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.27,0:09:09.15,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,All that occurs is inevitable.{XXXHOLiC?}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.77,0:09:13.28,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,So everything that happens has meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.99,0:09:16.07,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that only for the Celestial World?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.20,0:09:19.57,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Does that refer to those in the Spirit World too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.33,0:09:24.70,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,For all that exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.37,0:09:27.46,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.80,0:09:35.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.68,0:09:40.14,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank goodness I found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.43,0:09:42.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.64,0:09:46.27,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Why do you bother with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.19,0:09:48.85,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.65,0:09:51.40,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want to be thanked?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.19,0:09:54.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Then you’re looking in the wrong place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.23,0:09:56.53,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m not grateful or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.95,0:09:58.78,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I won’t be in the future, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.37,0:10:05.12,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san, it’s because you’re important to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.50,0:10:11.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s only natural to be concerned\Nfor someone you think is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.50,0:10:18.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei took possession of the organ.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.51,0:10:21.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t care either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.89,0:10:25.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san, it was important to you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.60,0:10:29.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You can go and play it whenever you want.{ori:I hope you can play it again some day.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.90,0:10:34.36,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.07,0:10:38.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san and Ioryogi-san are so much alike!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.99,0:10:41.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Like how you’re always angry…{ori:Especially when you’re angry…}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.74,0:10:44.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi… is that the stuffed animal you’re always carrying around?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.99,0:10:46.12,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.58,0:10:50.62,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But he’s really a nice person.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.62,0:10:52.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Achoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.46,0:10:54.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I better head back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.71,0:10:55.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.42,0:10:58.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kohaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.88,0:11:02.26,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’ve made your decision too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.18,0:11:04.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.60,0:11:07.54,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.81,0:11:13.40,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,How are you handling your laundry?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.86,0:11:17.44,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It must be difficult to hang them out to dry.{ori:It must be difficult to handle washing them.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.44,0:11:18.28,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.56,0:11:48.85,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.81,0:11:51.98,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.73,0:11:55.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I can’t be with you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.23,0:11:58.40,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s good to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.40,0:12:00.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll finally be released.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.90,0:12:05.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san, if you’re happy, I’m happy too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,18 eyecatch}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{bag}Medicine taken internally
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto Kiyokazu
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.14,0:12:34.60,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Take care now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.02,0:12:36.56,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.11,0:12:39.69,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.69,0:12:41.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s rather sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.86,0:12:43.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for taking care of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.65,0:12:47.37,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I would have liked to say goodbye\Nto Chiho-chan and Chise-chan too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.82,0:12:49.70,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sure they’ll miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.62,0:12:52.33,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What about Sayaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.33,0:12:54.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m going to see her now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.62,0:12:56.79,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.17,0:13:03.30,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s already been a year since you first came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.72,0:13:05.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.13,0:13:07.30,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Four seasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.30,0:13:10.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Spring, summer, autumn and winter…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.93,0:13:12.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,They were all fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.60,0:13:17.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Once you’ve settled, give us a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.31,0:13:22.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, once I’ve settled…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.28,0:13:32.18,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,My wish is already decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.75,0:13:40.50,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Dobato, do you know what that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.46,0:13:42.15,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.15,0:13:44.61,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don’t finish gathering the confetti, you’ll…!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.05,0:13:50.60,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t you care about what happens to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.35,0:13:56.85,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you an idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.73,0:13:59.44,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,Am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.06,0:14:02.32,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You are…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.48,0:14:05.82,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,A 100-point idiot…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.95,0:14:15.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san, thanks for waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.29,0:14:18.83,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you done saying your goodbyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.83,0:14:19.62,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.50,0:14:24.88,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Should we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.88,0:14:26.01,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.06,0:14:43.69,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, well, he’s not back yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.65,0:14:47.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh well, I guess it’s okay like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.16,0:14:55.37,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.37,0:14:56.83,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The moon’s shining.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.45,0:14:58.58,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.87,0:15:02.92,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.92,0:15:05.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it, Ioryogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.09,0:15:11.43,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Not doing anything and just being there… isn’t that a little painful?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.86,0:15:13.26,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Painful?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.72,0:15:15.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Why do you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.89,0:15:23.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Just being there… That’s amazing in itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.91,0:15:39.33,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you would’ve heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.33,0:15:40.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,No…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.00,0:15:44.67,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe it was hard for her to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.84,0:15:48.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Where did she say she was going?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.17,0:15:52.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, she only said she’d call when she'd settled in…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.18,0:15:55.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He left.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.74,0:16:15.74,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.76,0:16:38.26,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.26,0:16:39.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.47,0:16:40.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,She’s worked really hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.93,0:16:43.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,She’s a little bit of an idiot, clumsy and awkward,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.06,0:16:46.02,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,and she’s only good for being bright and honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.02,0:16:48.02,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,but she’s as good as anyone else as a human!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.02,0:16:50.11,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,She’s really got a good soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.44,0:16:53.11,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,So please… don’t erase her…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.49,0:16:57.62,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t erase her…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.62,0:17:03.71,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san. You’re troubling Ushagi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.76,0:17:14.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.47,0:17:17.80,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.80,0:17:19.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s what I’ve decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.72,0:17:22.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.10,0:17:27.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Ioryogi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.12,0:17:47.54,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’re you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.37,0:17:50.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.55,0:17:56.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.68,0:17:59.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.39,0:18:00.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you joking with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.51,0:18:03.68,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re angry with me to the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.02,0:18:05.31,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.31,0:18:08.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you think you’re pulling\Nby leaving without saying a word?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.39,0:18:09.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.81,0:18:14.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it because of what I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.19,0:18:15.53,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.53,0:18:16.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.86,0:18:17.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Then why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.32,0:18:23.16,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Because of her contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.83,0:18:24.54,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.74,0:18:26.41,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Over here, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.41,0:18:27.87,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,On top of the suitcase.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.79,0:18:30.71,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.00,0:18:34.67,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Ioryogi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.51,0:18:38.05,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that… the stuffed animal?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.47,0:18:40.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I was only pretending to be one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.85,0:18:46.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,About the contract…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.81,0:18:48.56,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, show him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.31,0:18:52.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.44,0:18:55.53,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, what do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.20,0:19:00.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.78,0:19:02.45,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.78,0:19:05.58,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,She’s dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.58,0:19:11.71,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato’s soul right now doesn’t reside in any world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.71,0:19:14.46,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,She’s an ambiguous existence without any real life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.38,0:19:18.59,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But after making a contract with the Big Guy,{ori:But after making a contract with the guys up top,}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.59,0:19:23.14,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,she was given a chance to be reborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.14,0:19:24.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait a moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.22,0:19:25.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.68,0:19:26.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.68,0:19:34.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato chose to spend the remaining time of her contract with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.86,0:19:38.32,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Therefore, her contract will be broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.41,0:19:48.74,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s why I have to disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.87,0:19:52.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.21,0:19:57.92,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I was very happy to be by your side, Fujimoto-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.47,0:20:03.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,This won’t do…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.18,0:20:07.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted you to be smiling in the end…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.56,0:20:15.48,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.27,0:20:17.98,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.11,0:20:21.36,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.57,0:20:25.91,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,...is my important person.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.62,0:20:28.66,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Up until now…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.45,0:20:31.83,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And from now on…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.00,0:20:34.12,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Always…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.96,0:20:36.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.28,0:21:03.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Confetti?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.16,0:21:11.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.33,0:21:16.08,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The confetti…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.67,0:21:19.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,...is being accepted.{ori:gathering.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.05,0:21:28.47,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-san’s wish has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.76,0:21:32.85,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,But the contract cannot be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.14,0:21:36.35,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,She’ll go to the place she wished for.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.69,0:21:41.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san’s confetti…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.78,0:21:43.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.53,0:21:47.36,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn’t this more like a curse?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.36,0:21:48.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.53,0:21:51.62,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let her reincarnate in this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.58,0:22:01.63,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.17,0:22:05.05,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for not being able to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.01,0:22:07.30,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.72,0:22:09.47,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,The same goes for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.47,0:22:11.85,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,After being with her for the longest…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.06,0:22:14.77,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,...I can’t do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.18,0:22:20.52,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,But if everything that occurs is inevitable…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.15,0:22:23.73,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’s going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.90,0:22:28.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I have to go to the place I belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.95,0:22:32.33,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.16,0:22:34.87,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait…!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{ending}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:05.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
